#: ../../../../build/xtrkcad-old/app/help/messages.h:9
#, c-format
msgid ""
"MSG_CANT_PLACE_FROGPOINTS\tFrog|Points cannot be placed on a turnout, circle"
" or helix.\tA %s cannot be placed on a turnout, circle or helix."
